# A held value across eviction ([LNUL.8.6], [LSER.9.3.2]).
#
# Pump 1    a number and a string, absorbed at 0 s.
# 120 s     `Other` makes a pump read a clock past both windows: libds frees
#           the rows.
# 180 s     nulls, each absorbing the held value.
# 190 s     values, whose rules read the held samples before their own.
assert Reading dev=k level=5.0 label=hello n=1
pump
advance 120000000000
assert Other k=1
pump
advance 60000000000
assert Reading dev=k level=null label=null n=2
pump
advance 10000000000
assert Reading dev=k level=7.0 label=next n=3
pump
